# tamamdır Support

Thanks for using tamamdır!
If you need any help, have questions, or want to report an issue, you can reach us through the options below.

## Contact
- Email: byteheus@gmail.com
- Support page: https://github.com/merttdyrgn/tamamdir-Support
- Privacy Policy: https://github.com/merttdyrgn/tamamdir-Support/blob/main/Privacy%20Policy

## Report a Bug
If you encounter a problem in the app:
1. Email us at byteheus@gmail.com, or open an Issue on this repository.
2. Include your device model, iOS version, and the steps to reproduce the problem.
3. Screenshots help a lot when something looks wrong on screen.

## Feature Requests
Have an idea that would make tamamdır better?
Feel free to email us or open a Feature Request issue on this repository.

## Account & Data
- Change your display name, language, and notifications in Settings.
- Remove a friend anytime from Settings → Friends.
- Delete your profile in Settings to erase your account and server-side data.

---

We do our best to respond as soon as possible. Thank you for supporting tamamdır!
